{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12658","headline":"系乐府十二首 下客谣 · 元结","name":"系乐府十二首 下客谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"下客无黄金，岂思主人怜。\n客言胜黄金，主人然不然。\n珠玉成彩翠，绮罗如婵娟。\n终恐见斯好，有时去君前。\n岂知保忠信，长使令德全。\n风声与时茂，歌颂万千年。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元结","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12658.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12658","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}